    <ul>
      <li><strong>LEO is no longer a niche regime.</strong> At {stats['leo_share']:.1f}% of the active fleet, Low Earth Orbit has become the default destination for new spacecraft. Spectrum and debris policies must treat LEO as a congested environment, not an open frontier.</li>
