      <li><strong>Growth is accelerating, not plateauing.</strong> The post-2020 curve is exponential in character. Even if launch rates stabilize, the sheer mass of objects already on orbit guarantees rising conjunction frequencies and increased demand for space situational awareness (SSA) services.</li>
